cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "fdo-architecture: architecture overview of the FDOx repository family"
abstract: >-
  A hand-maintained registry.yaml describing the repositories of the FDOx
  family, their roles, and what artefact each one produces or consumes from
  another, rendered into a Mermaid diagram and a static overview page. Kept
  separate from the repositories it describes so that a change to the family
  does not require touching any of them.
